{
  "_comment": [
    "What Alertmanager makes of a routing timing value (#2490): `am_valid` / `am_ns`",
    "/ `am_error` are prometheus/common model.ParseDuration's verdict on `value`",
    "(the version in components/threshold-exporter/app/go.mod, named in `source`).",
    "⛔ Never hand-edit those columns: add a row with only `value`, then run",
    "`DA_REGEN_AM_DURATION_MATRIX=1 go test ./pkg/config -run TestAMDurationMatrix`",
    "in components/threshold-exporter/app, which writes them from Go.",
    "Go half: pkg/config/am_duration_parity_test.go (the file says what Go says;",
    "the exporter's clampDuration drops exactly the invalid rows). Python half:",
    "tests/shared/test_am_duration_parity.py (the route generator's parser and",
    "tenant-config.schema.json definitions.duration agree with `am_valid`; the",
    "schema pattern cannot see overflow, and only overflow rows may differ)."
  ],
